    <bpmn:process id="W_W1201" name="W1201. Intercompany Monthly Settlement Batch Processing &amp; Netting Execution" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly intercompany settlement cycle (5th business day of following month)
Frequency: Monthly
Volume: ~100–200 IC transactions/month across 5 entities; ~10 IC relationship pairs (5 entities × 4 counterparty pairs)
Owner: Chief Accountant
Participants: Chief Accountant, Controller, Treasury Manager, CFO
Source: workflow W1201 — Intercompany Monthly Settlement Batch Processing &amp; Netting Execution</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1201_LaneSet5">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1201_Lane1" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1201_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1201_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1201_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1201_Start6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1201_Lane2" name="Chief Accountant">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1201_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1201_Task13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1201_Lane3" name="Controller">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1201_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1201_Lane4" name="Treasury Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1201_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1201_End14</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1201_Start6" name="Monthly intercompany settlement cycle (5th business day of following month)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1201_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1201_Task7" name="IC transaction completeness verification">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: IC transaction completeness verification: System runs IC completeness check: (a) all IC transactions for the month must be posted and approved across all 5 entities, (b) system matches each IC receivable (AR-IC) with corresponding IC payable (AP-IC) by entity pair; flags unmatched entries (timing differences, missing entries, amount mismatches)
Responsible (R): System / Chief Accountant
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: 1 hour</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1201_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1201_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1201_Task8" name="Unmatched entry resolution">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Unmatched entry resolution: For any unmatched IC entries from Step 1: Chief Accountant contacts the originating entity&#x27;s accountant to resolve: (a) timing differences (entity A posted in month, entity B not yet) → entity B records accrual, (b) amount mismatch → investigate and correct, (c) missing entry → identify source and record; all mismatches must be resolved before settlement proceeds
Responsible (R): Chief Accountant
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: 1–2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1201_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1201_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1201_Task9" name="IC balance netting calculation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: IC balance netting calculation: System calculates net IC balance for each entity pair: (a) generates IC netting matrix showing gross receivable, gross payable, and net position for each of the 10 entity pairs, (b) identifies opportunities for multilateral netting: e.g., if Depot Inc. owes Logistics Inc. PHP 5M and Logistics Inc. owes Property Management Inc. PHP 2M and Property Management Inc. owes Depot Inc. PHP 3M, system nets to single cash movements, (c) produces proposed settlement schedule with minimum number of cash transfers
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1201_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1201_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1201_Task10" name="Settlement approval">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Settlement approval: Chief Accountant presents proposed settlement schedule to Controller for approval; Controller verifies: (a) all IC balances are reconciled (no unmatched entries), (b) netting calculations are correct, (c) settlement amounts are consistent with IC rate agreements per W612; CFO approves settlements &gt; PHP 10M net
Responsible (R): Controller
Accountable (A): CFO (for &gt; PHP 10M)
Duration: 30 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1201_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1201_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1201_Task11" name="Cash settlement execution">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Cash settlement execution: Treasury Manager executes approved cash transfers between entity bank accounts: (a) transfers net payable amounts via intra-bank transfer (BDO to BDO for same-bank entities; CHATS/RTGS for cross-bank), (b) system records: DR: AP-IC / CR: Bank (paying entity) and DR: Bank / CR: AR-IC (receiving entity), (c) ensures each entity pair settles to zero or near-zero balance (residual &lt; PHP 10K due to rounding carried forward)
Responsible (R): Treasury Manager
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: 1 hour</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1201_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1201_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1201_Task12" name="Consolidation elimination verification">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Consolidation elimination verification: System runs consolidation elimination routine: (a) verifies all IC revenue/expense pairs net to zero at consolidated level, (b) verifies all IC receivable/payable pairs net to zero, (c) flags any remaining IC balances for investigation, (d) generates consolidation elimination journal entries
Responsible (R): System / Chief Accountant
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: 30 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1201_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1201_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1201_Task13" name="Monthly IC settlement report">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Monthly IC settlement report: Chief Accountant prepares monthly IC settlement summary for CFO: (a) total IC transaction volume by type (rent, warehousing fees, e-commerce fees, management fees), (b) gross vs. net settlement amounts, (c) number of unmatched entries resolved, (d) residual IC balances carried forward, (e) comparison to prior month and budget
Responsible (R): Chief Accountant
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 1 hour</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1201_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1201_Flow24</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1201_End14" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1201_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1201_Annotation15">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-290 (ensure controlled execution — Consolidation &amp; Intercompany (PA-17.2).) | - operational: enforcing synchronized month-end close across all 5 entities per W10 (financial close) and requiring IC accruals for unmatched entries in Step 2; operational: Treasury Manager&#x27;s cash flow forecast per W57 that incorporates IC settlement schedule; operational: complete audit trail in Steps 1–7
Owner: Chief Accountant</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W1201_Assoc16" sourceRef="W1201_Annotation15" targetRef="W1201_Start6" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1201_Flow17" sourceRef="W1201_Start6" targetRef="W1201_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1201_Flow18" sourceRef="W1201_Task7" targetRef="W1201_Task8" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1201_Flow19" sourceRef="W1201_Task8" targetRef="W1201_Task9" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1201_Flow20" sourceRef="W1201_Task9" targetRef="W1201_Task10" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1201_Flow21" sourceRef="W1201_Task10" targetRef="W1201_Task11" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1201_Flow22" sourceRef="W1201_Task11" targetRef="W1201_Task12" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1201_Flow23" sourceRef="W1201_Task12" targetRef="W1201_Task13" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1201_Flow24" sourceRef="W1201_Task13" targetRef="W1201_End14" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W1201_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W1201_plane" bpmnElement="W_W1201">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W1201_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W1201_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="1790" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W1201_Lane2_di" bpmnElement="W1201_Lane2" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="250" width="1790" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
