    <bpmn:process id="W_W1417" name="W1417. Intercompany E-Commerce Platform Per-Order Fee Monthly Calculation, Settlement &amp; Revenue Recognition" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly intercompany settlement cycle; or month-end close deadline
Frequency: Monthly
Volume: ~42,900 ecommerce orders/month; per-order fulfillment fee charged by BuildRight Digital Commerce, Inc. to BuildRight Depot, Inc.
Owner: Controller
Participants: Controller, E-Commerce Finance Analyst, AP Clerk, AR Clerk, Consolidation Accountant
Source: workflow W1417 — Intercompany E-Commerce Platform Per-Order Fee Monthly Calculation, Settlement &amp; Revenue Recognition</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1417_LaneSet5">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1417_Lane1" name="E-Commerce Finance Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1417_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1417_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1417_Start6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1417_Lane2" name="AP Clerk">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1417_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1417_Lane3" name="Consolidation Accountant">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1417_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1417_Lane4" name="Controller">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1417_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1417_End12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1417_Start6" name="Monthly intercompany settlement cycle; or month-end close deadline">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1417_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1417_Task7" name="Monthly order reconciliation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Monthly order reconciliation: E-Commerce Finance Analyst reconciles ecommerce orders for the month: (a) total orders placed on platform (Digital Commerce Inc. system) vs. total orders fulfilled (Depot Inc. ERP — goods receipt or BOPIS pickup confirmation), (b) identify unmatched orders: (i) placed but not fulfilled (customer cancelled, abandoned BOPIS pickup per W771), (ii) fulfilled but not recorded on platform (system sync error), (c) reconciled order count = basis for fee calculation
Responsible (R): E-Commerce Finance Analyst
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: 3–4 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1417_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1417_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1417_Task8" name="Fee calculation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Fee calculation: E-Commerce Finance Analyst calculates monthly fee: (a) per-order fulfillment fee rate per intercompany service agreement (W1218), e.g., PHP 35/order for BOPIS + PHP 55/order for home delivery, (b) fee = (BOPIS orders × BOPIS rate) + (delivery orders × delivery rate) + ad-hoc services (product photography, content updates), (c) generate IC invoice: Digital Commerce Inc. → Depot Inc.
Responsible (R): E-Commerce Finance Analyst
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: 1–2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1417_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1417_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1417_Task9" name="Cash remittance">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Cash remittance: (a) Digital Commerce Inc. remits collected customer payments to Depot Inc.: total GMV collected in the month, (b) net settlement = customer payments collected − IC fulfillment fee, (c) if net settlement is positive: Digital Commerce pays Depot Inc.; if negative (unlikely — fee exceeds collections): Depot Inc. pays Digital Commerce Inc., (d) AP/AR Clerks post IC invoice and payment per W14 (intercompany transactions)
Responsible (R): AP Clerk / AR Clerk
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: 2–3 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1417_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1417_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1417_Task10" name="Revenue recognition entries">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Revenue recognition entries: Consolidation Accountant posts month-end entries: (a) Depot Inc.: recognizes ecommerce revenue at fulfillment point (Dr. IC Receivable / Cr. Revenue), recognizes IC fee expense (Dr. IC Platform Fee Expense / Cr. IC Payable to Digital Commerce), (b) Digital Commerce Inc.: recognizes platform fee revenue (Dr. IC Receivable from Depot / Cr. IC Platform Fee Revenue), recognizes cost of platform operations (Dr. Platform Operating Expense / Cr. Cash/AP), (c) elimination entries in consolidation: IC platform fee revenue (Digital Commerce) eliminates against IC platform fee expense (Depot) — zero net impact on consolidated P&amp;L
Responsible (R): Consolidation Accountant
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: 2–3 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1417_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1417_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1417_Task11" name="Quarterly rate review">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Quarterly rate review: per W612, Controller reviews per-order fee rate quarterly: (a) compare fee rate to market benchmarks (third-party ecommerce platform fees in the Philippines: PHP 20–80/order), (b) verify Digital Commerce Inc. is covering its operating costs + reasonable margin, (c) adjust rates if needed per arm&#x27;s-length documentation per W1299
Responsible (R): Controller
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 2–3 hours/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1417_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1417_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1417_End12" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1417_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1417_Annotation13">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-290 (ensure controlled execution — Consolidation &amp; Intercompany (PA-17.2).) | - operational: Controller review and approval gate; operational: periodic reconciliation against source documents
Owner: Controller</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W1417_Assoc14" sourceRef="W1417_Annotation13" targetRef="W1417_Start6" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1417_Flow15" sourceRef="W1417_Start6" targetRef="W1417_Task7" />
